      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly
Frequency: Monthly; ecommerce return-request rate ~0.6–0.8% (the W1623 canon)
Volume: All fulfillment sources
Owner: Returns Manager
Participants: VP Supply Chain
Source: workflow W2308 — Return Rate by Fulfillment Source</bpmn:documentation>
