      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual
Frequency: Annual
Volume: Full strategy
Owner: VP Marketing / VP Supply Chain
Participants: CIO, CFO, CEO
Source: workflow W2309 — Omnichannel Fulfillment Strategy Annual Review</bpmn:documentation>
