        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Joint review: channel mix, source allocation, cost, SLAs, satisfaction, competitive position; CIO presents tech roadmap; CFO presents financial impact; COO approves plan
Responsible (R): VP Marketing / VP Supply Chain / CIO / CFO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 3–5 days + 2–3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2309_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2309_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
